    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Edits a Case Statuses Risk Point" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Edit & Revert Case Status Risk Point</p>
            <p>Updates the first case status risk point to 5, verifies success, then reverts to 1</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Settings → Case Statuses Risk Points. 2. Click Edit on the first row. 3. Change risk point to 5 and Save. 4. Confirm success toast. 5. Click Edit again and change risk point back to 1. 6. Save and confirm success.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Toast "The case status risk point has been updated." appears after each save.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
    </chapter>

